@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:我们在案发现场<br>发现了蜡烛。|#0104Trial02_Margo001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR1,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:蜡烛<br>有使用过的痕迹，<br>地上也残留有<br>蜡油的痕迹……|#0104Trial02_Margo002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR1,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Middle,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:这就证明了，<br>亚里沙<br>曾经使用过<br>这根蜡烛。|#0104Trial02_Margo003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR3,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:那又怎样？<br>有人点燃过<br>蜡烛，<br>这能证明什么？|#0104Trial02_Coco001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"【需要<link=\"Objection_01_04_02_01\">使用蜡烛</link>的情况】……<br>大家觉得那会是<br>怎样的情况？|#0104Trial02_Margo004|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal1,ArmR1_1,ArmL8,Eyes1_Pensive_Open1,Mouth1_Normal_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:需要照明的时候……<br>对吗？|#0104Trial02_Meruru001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR1,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Middle,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:没错。<br>也就是说，<br>亚里沙是在【晚上】<br>来到这个审判庭的。|#0104Trial02_Margo005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:因此我推断，<br>亚里沙是<br>在我们无法外出的<br>时间段……|#0104Trial02_Margo006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"在这个漆黑一片的<br>【<link=\"Objection_01_04_02_02\">深夜的审判庭</link>】中<br>遭到了杀害。|#0104Trial02_Margo007|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR6,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:可是昨晚<br>我们都回到<br>各自的房间去了。|#0104Trial02_Margo008| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR6,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:除了没有待在牢房，<br>行踪不明的<br>奈叶香以外，<br>没有人能作案。|#0104Trial02_Margo009| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……这下你明白了吗？<br>可爱的小艾玛。|#0104Trial02_Margo010| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4


